@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@
       "admin-money": "Open a bank account, find a cheaper way to send money home, and keep track of your visa dates so you don't miss an extension.",
       "daily-life": "Everyday things that work differently in Korea: sorting trash, choosing a hospital or pharmacy, emergency numbers, holidays and the apps locals use.",
